{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the original creators of <strong>Necroking</strong> comes a new turn-based strategy \u2014 <strong>MechaMice</strong>, a full-3D clay-motion combat game set on spherical battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>When a particle accelerator accident opened a rift in space, the galaxy was invaded by Void Cats. Only one force stood in their way: highly intelligent Mice piloting heavily armed Mechs...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Spherical Battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight on 3D hex spheres with height levels and destructible terrain. Each mech gets 1 move and 1 attack ability \u2014 feel free to\u00a0bite, claw, snipe, teleport or demolish your enemy. Every skill is tuned for curved, tactical arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022220/extras/ee17fd5a67cc37ff8c752038a6989b06.poster.avif?t=1762935249\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022220/extras/ee17fd5a67cc37ff8c752038a6989b06.webm?t=1762935249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Tactics and Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a squad of 3 mouse mechs, complete missions and pursue bonus goals. Travel across a star map, upgrade units and collect rare cores for new mechs and global boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022220/extras/f1a580c7f6bae92359583ba726bc4c29.poster.avif?t=1762935249\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022220/extras/f1a580c7f6bae92359583ba726bc4c29.webm?t=1762935249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc2d Cosmic Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful mouse civilization falls to an interdimensional catastrophe as space-plasma creatures invade. Through animated cutscenes and comic-style stories, uncover how the MechaMice rise to reclaim infected worlds and stop the spreading anomaly before it engulfs the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022220/extras/f2aaf29456304f827cab327dc14a3a7f.poster.avif?t=1762935249\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022220/extras/f2aaf29456304f827cab327dc14a3a7f.webm?t=1762935249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Tactics, cheese, and cosmic cats. Get ready to save the galaxy!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022220?t=1762935249","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022220/d5d56d9b216d019c8aec1fca82555052f36de1ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762935249","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022220/ff247f77043dfc7e6c5405aa50512d10e38a5651/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762935249","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022220/ff247f77043dfc7e6c5405aa50512d10e38a5651/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762935249","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}